# Artificial Evolution replaces the creature type Lizard with Elf in Hired Claw's text for good (CR 612.1): "Whenever you
# attack with one or more Elves" - the word is read through the Claw's own words. Elvish Mystic, an Elf, attacks alone
# on turn 3 and triggers it (20 - 1 - 1 = 18); without the change it would not (the neighbouring scenario).

